msgid "内核线程与 worker"
msgstr "Kernel threads and workers"

msgid ""
"``include/reliefnt/kthread.h`` 提供 ReliefNT 的内核内部线程接口。线程具有 独立 64 KiB 栈和保留的 "
"SysV x86-64 调用现场，可在让出、睡眠和安全的 定时器返回后继续原来的函数，而不是重新调用一次入口。此接口参考 Linux "
"的线程式工作队列机制，但不承诺 Linux 内部 kthread API/二进制兼容； 不新增或修改用户态 Linux/POSIX ABI。"
msgstr ""
"``include/reliefnt/kthread.h`` provides ReliefNT's internal kernel thread "
"interface. Threads have independent 64 KiB stacks and preserved SysV x86-64 "
"call contexts, allowing the original function to resume after yielding, "
"sleeping, or a safe timer return instead of calling the entry point again. "
"This interface draws on Linux's threaded workqueue mechanism but promises no"
" compatibility with Linux internal kthread APIs or binaries; it neither adds"
" nor changes the userspace Linux/POSIX ABI."

msgid "创建和调度"
msgstr "Creation and scheduling"

msgid ""
"``kthread_create`` 创建停止的线程；``kthread_wake`` 发布就绪状态。 线程固定到创建时指定的已发现 "
"CPU，不迁移保留的栈或驱动执行事务令牌。 CPU 启动失败时其线程不运行，仍可停止并回收；目前不提供 CPU 热插拔。 外部 "
"``sched_setaffinity`` 对这些固定 CPU 内核任务返回 ``EINVAL``， ``sched_getaffinity`` "
"继续报告其真实绑定，不接受只改掩码却不迁移的操作。"
msgstr ""
"``kthread_create`` creates a stopped thread; ``kthread_wake`` publishes its "
"ready state. A thread is pinned to the discovered CPU specified at creation "
"and does not migrate its preserved stack or driver execution-transaction "
"token. If a CPU fails to start, its threads do not run but can still be "
"stopped and reclaimed; CPU hotplug is currently unavailable. External "
"``sched_setaffinity`` returns ``EINVAL`` for these CPU-pinned kernel tasks, "
"while ``sched_getaffinity`` continues to report their actual binding; "
"changing only the mask without migration is not accepted."

msgid ""
"线程由独立的每 CPU 就绪 FIFO 派发。用户任务继续使用现有 EEVDF 队列， 调度边界每次最多派发一个内核线程执行轮次。 "
"一个轮次结束后，用户返回路径至少留出至下一 tick 的用户运行窗口，避免 连续缺页/系统调用返回反复运行后台线程而饿住用户程序。该窗口使用现有 "
"调度器时钟限制为最多一个 tick（当前 10 ms），不因 BSP/PIT 中断延后而 无限延长其他 CPU 的后台等待。空闲及显式 join "
"排空路径直接推进就绪线程，不受此用户运行窗口限制。worker 必须在 init 已取得 PID 1 后创建，保留 Linux 启动进程和孤儿回收的 "
"PID 1 语义。"
msgstr ""
"Threads are dispatched from independent per-CPU ready FIFOs. User tasks "
"continue to use the existing EEVDF queue, and each scheduling boundary "
"dispatches at most one kernel-thread execution round. After a round, the "
"user-return path reserves a user execution window lasting at least until the"
" next tick, so repeated page-fault/syscall returns do not repeatedly run "
"background threads and starve user programs. The existing scheduler clock "
"caps this window at one tick (currently 10 ms), preventing delayed BSP/PIT "
"interrupts from indefinitely extending background waits on other CPUs. Idle "
"and explicit join-draining paths advance ready threads directly, without "
"this user execution window restriction. Workers must be created after init "
"has obtained PID 1, preserving Linux PID 1 semantics for the initial process"
" and orphan reaping."

msgid ""
"派发时保存原调用任务的 CPU 预留，切换到内核页表并发布真实的内核线程 任务身份；返回时恢复预留和页表。这样，睡眠中的用户返回栈不会被其他 CPU "
"并发使用或回收，驱动也不会误用被中断用户的 PID、文件描述符或地址空间。 CPU 时间计入当前内核线程的 system "
"ticks，用户的公平调度间隔在其间暂停。 内核仍使用 general-regs-only 编译；线程不可使用用户的浮点/TLS 状态。"
msgstr ""
"Dispatch saves the original calling task's CPU reservation, switches to "
"kernel page tables, and publishes the actual kernel-thread task identity; "
"return restores the reservation and page tables. This prevents other CPUs "
"from concurrently using or reclaiming a sleeping user-return stack and "
"prevents drivers from mistakenly using the interrupted user's PID, file "
"descriptors, or address space. CPU time is charged to the current kernel "
"thread's system ticks, while the user's fair-scheduling interval is paused. "
"The kernel is still compiled with general-regs-only; threads must not use "
"the user's floating-point/TLS state."

msgid "抢占与临界区"
msgstr "Preemption and critical sections"

msgid ""
"PIT、AP 定时器及调度 IPI 完成中断确认后，可切走正在独立栈上执行的内核 线程。只接受原中断允许 IRQ、没有执行 writer、没有 "
"plain 自旋锁的 CPL0 线程栈；普通 syscall、空闲、异常、NMI、IST 及外借服务栈不走此返回切换。 IRQ-save 自旋锁和 "
"reader 事务保留原来的关中断规则。"
msgstr ""
"After the PIT, AP timer, or scheduling IPI acknowledges its interrupt, it "
"can switch away from a kernel thread executing on its independent stack. "
"Only CPL0 thread stacks whose interrupted state allowed IRQs, with no "
"execution writer and no plain spinlock, are eligible; ordinary syscall, "
"idle, exception, NMI, IST, and borrowed service stacks do not use this "
"return switch. IRQ-save spinlocks and reader transactions retain their "
"existing interrupt-disabling rules."

msgid ""
"普通自旋锁在等待和持锁期间禁止线程调度。工作函数调用 ``kthread_yield``、``kthread_sleep_until`` "
"前也必须释放执行事务及所有锁， 并保持任务中断开启。旧驱动可保留原来的执行事务 suspend/resume 等待协议； 暂停状态在其固定 CPU "
"上恢复。这里不启用所有内核代码的任意位置抢占， 长时间持锁的代码仍需单独缩短临界区。"
msgstr ""
"Ordinary spinlocks disable thread scheduling both while waiting and while "
"held. Work functions must also release execution transactions and all locks "
"and keep task interrupts enabled before calling ``kthread_yield`` or "
"``kthread_sleep_until``. Older drivers can retain their existing execution-"
"transaction suspend/resume waiting protocol; suspended state resumes on its "
"pinned CPU. This does not enable preemption at arbitrary points throughout "
"kernel code; code that holds locks for a long time still needs its critical "
"sections shortened separately."

msgid "睡眠、停止和所有权"
msgstr "Sleeping, stopping, and ownership"

msgid ""
"``kthread_sleep_until`` 使用绝对单调 tick；``UINT64_MAX`` 表示只等待事件。 唤醒合并且保留 sleep "
"之前发布的事件，调用方始终循环检查实际条件。 ``kthread_join`` 等待最后一次函数返回；``kthread_stop`` 发布停止请求、 "
"唤醒线程并 join。函数应检查 ``kthread_should_stop``，停止不会强行丢弃仍有 锁、DMA "
"或模块调用的栈。尚未运行的线程可直接停止，返回 ``-EINTR``。 同一线程等待自身得到 ``-EDEADLK``。"
msgstr ""
"``kthread_sleep_until`` uses absolute monotonic ticks; ``UINT64_MAX`` means "
"wait only for events. Wakeups are coalesced, and events published before "
"sleep are retained; callers always check the actual condition in a loop. "
"``kthread_join`` waits for the final function return; ``kthread_stop`` "
"publishes a stop request, wakes the thread, and joins it. Functions should "
"check ``kthread_should_stop``; stopping does not forcibly discard a stack "
"that still holds locks, DMA, or module calls. A thread that has not yet run "
"can be stopped directly, returning ``-EINTR``. A thread waiting for itself "
"receives ``-EDEADLK``."

msgid ""
"同步 join/取消允许临时释放深度一的执行事务。在本 CPU 等待的普通任务可 推进内核线程调度；内核线程等待者则睡眠，让其他线程和用户任务继续运行。"
" 这只用于显式等待，不把维护重新放回普通 syscall 入口。"
msgstr ""
"Synchronous join/cancel may temporarily release a depth-one execution "
"transaction. An ordinary task waiting on this CPU can advance kernel-thread "
"scheduling; a kernel-thread waiter sleeps, allowing other threads and user "
"tasks to continue. This is limited to explicit waits and does not put "
"maintenance back into ordinary syscall entry points."

msgid ""
"模块在 COMING 阶段可创建线程，但首次 wake 只接受 LIVE owner。从首次 获准唤醒到函数最终返回、独立栈离开 "
"CPU，核心持续持有模块执行 pin。 模块清理账本先关闭准入、请求停止并 join，最后才释放线程栈和模块代码。 "
"``kthread_destroy`` 对模块线程只禁用并停止它，存储保留到最终账本释放。 永久代码的调用者先停止全部外部唤醒源，再销毁自己持有的句柄。"
msgstr ""
"A module may create threads during COMING, but the first wake accepts only a"
" LIVE owner. From the first admitted wake until the function's final return "
"and the independent stack leaving the CPU, the core continuously holds a "
"module execution pin. The module cleanup ledger first closes admission, "
"requests stop, and joins, and only then releases thread stacks and module "
"code. For module threads, ``kthread_destroy`` only disables and stops the "
"thread; storage remains until final ledger release. Callers in permanent "
"code must stop all external wakeup sources before destroying their handles."

msgid "存储和工作队列"
msgstr "Storage and workqueues"

msgid ""
"后台上下文使用同步存储标志，不继承用户 syscall 的可重试状态；退出调度 轮次后恢复原调用者的确切标志。已有异步 DMA 命令的 PID "
"所有权仍保留， 后台 I/O 遇到另一任务的 pending owner 返回 ``EAGAIN``，不会复用它的命令。 "
"这不扩大存储并行范围，也不取代已有设备和执行锁。"
msgstr ""
"Background contexts use synchronous storage flags and do not inherit the "
"retryable state of a user syscall; the original caller's exact flags are "
"restored after the scheduling round. Existing asynchronous DMA commands "
"retain PID ownership; background I/O encountering another task's pending "
"owner returns ``EAGAIN`` rather than reusing its command. This neither "
"expands storage concurrency nor replaces existing device and execution "
"locks."

msgid ""
"``kworker/N:0`` 消费已有工作项的四回调/2 ms 批次。批次结束后让出或睡眠， 单次队列通知只唤醒一个在线 worker，轮换 "
"CPU；空闲 worker 只等待事件， 延迟工作的到期通知统一由队列 timer 发布，避免所有 CPU 为同一项工作 同时争用执行锁。 "
"回调本身继续遵守其原有锁和模块所有权规则。队列按线程身份判断自等待， 同 CPU 的其他任务可以等待一个暂停的回调；实际回调等待自身仍被拒绝。"
msgstr ""
"``kworker/N:0`` consumes existing work items in batches of four callbacks/2 "
"ms. It yields or sleeps after a batch; a single queue notification wakes "
"only one online worker, rotating among CPUs. Idle workers wait only for "
"events, and delayed-work expiry notifications are published centrally by the"
" queue timer, preventing all CPUs from contending for the execution lock for"
" the same work item. Callbacks retain their existing locking and module "
"ownership rules. The queue detects self-wait by thread identity; another "
"task on the same CPU may wait for a paused callback, while a callback "
"actually waiting for itself is still rejected."

msgid ""
"USB 注销在 host 回调仍 active 时返回 ``EBUSY``，不设置不可重试的 closing 状态，也不持执行事务等待暂停的 "
"worker。模块保留 GOING 资源，回调完成后 可重试清理。PCM 最终关闭遇到正在断开或使用中的 stream 返回 ``EAGAIN``， "
"由既有释放队列保留 lease/code/DMA 后重试，避免同 CPU 关闭路径阻挡 worker。"
msgstr ""
"USB unregistration returns ``EBUSY`` while host callbacks remain active, "
"without setting an unretryable closing state or waiting for a paused worker "
"while holding an execution transaction. The module retains GOING resources, "
"and cleanup can be retried after callbacks finish. Final PCM close returns "
"``EAGAIN`` when a stream is disconnecting or in use; the existing release "
"queue retains the lease/code/DMA and retries, preventing a close path on the"
" same CPU from blocking the worker."

msgid "验证入口"
msgstr "Validation entry points"

msgid ""
"``tools/test_kthread.py`` 使用实际汇编切换、实际线程引擎和执行锁，验证 栈保留、让出、延时、提前唤醒、停止、模块 pin 和同"
" CPU 回调取消；另用 实际存储上下文实现验证重试标志及竞争 pending owner 的隔离。 "
"``tools/tests/kmodules/kthread_probe/`` 是独立外部测试模块，以不主动让出的 CPU 0 线程验证定时器抢占、同 "
"CPU 用户进展、睡眠唤醒和实际卸载排空。 测试模块不属于 defconfig 或正式镜像。"
msgstr ""
"``tools/test_kthread.py`` uses the actual assembly context switch, thread "
"engine, and execution lock to validate stack preservation, yielding, delays,"
" early wakeup, stopping, module pins, and callback cancellation on the same "
"CPU. It also uses the actual storage-context implementation to validate "
"isolation of retry flags and competing pending owners. "
"``tools/tests/kmodules/kthread_probe/`` is an independent external test "
"module; a CPU 0 thread that does not voluntarily yield validates timer "
"preemption, user progress on the same CPU, sleep/wakeup, and draining during"
" actual unloading. The test module is not part of defconfig or official "
"images."
